OL,3,ANo order, no seat: Starbucks China
OL,4,Arolls out new store policy
OL,5,
OL,6,FTaking a seat at a Starbucks in China?
OL,7,FJust make sure you're also ordering
OL,8,Fsomething there.
OL,10,FA new policy by Starbucks China takes
OL,11,Feffect across all its 8,000 stores on
OL,12,FThursday, making it mandatory for
OL,13,Fpeople to purchase items if they want
OL,14,Fto sit in its cafes.
OL,16,FStarbucks China said the move was part
OL,17,Fof efforts to improve the "in-store
OL,18,Fexperience" for customers. The company
OL,19,Fis facing stiff competition from
OL,20,Fhomegrown brands such as Luckin Coffee.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
