OL,3,ANo order, no seat: Starbucks China
OL,4,Arolls out new store policy
OL,5,
OL,6,FStarbucks stores around the world have
OL,7,Falso been wrestling with non-paying
OL,8,Fseat-hoggers and other undesirable
OL,9,Fbehaviour from customers.
